                                "sense_id": "43006039-8469-3fda-a807-3221c8adebfa",
                                "text": "People with gluttonish inclinations can easily and do make themselves sick while subsisting on an entirely fruit diet; hence, if discretion is needed in the use of the simplest articles of food, of course it cannot be dispensed with while indulging in other sorts."
                            },
                            {
